      "extract": "Conclusions In this paper we have developed the linear programming method for the unitary space time codes. We have obtained both numerical and analytic bounds. The 9 results improve previously known bounds. Furthermore the linear programming method allows to deal with non-distance functions as the diversity product di- rectly. Acknowledgment The authors would like to thank Christine Bachoc for her precious advises",
